msgid "If this video needs an account, Arroxy uses your Explore sign-in automatically. It may be unavailable for another reason."
msgstr "Ikiwa video hii inahitaji akaunti, Arroxy hutumia kuingia kwako kwenye Gundua kiotomatiki. Huenda isipatikane kwa sababu nyingine."

